Service/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5088440,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5088440-1847286114037492","game_id":"steam-5088440","kind":"announcement","title":"Rip It! Card Collector Hits 40K Wishlists! 🎊","summary":"Hey recruits! We hit 40K wishlists for Rip It! Card Collector, and want to give a huge THANK YOU to everyone who played our demo! We're incredibly stoked about this. The team behind the desk is implementing player feedback and tossing surprise, unwanted bug cards that appeared in the demo. Ready to start your collection? The weekend is the perfect chance to set up at the desk, explore the binder, shake a piggy bank, and see what's happening!As a reminder: the full game comes out October 30th! Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:10:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037492","verified_at":"2026-10-23T21:21:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5088440-1847286114029619","game_id":"steam-5088440","kind":"announcement","title":"Rip It! Card Collector Launches Next Week: Here’s What’s in the Pack!","summary":"Hey recruits!Launch day is almost here, and Team Ballistic has been busy stocking the shelves. Whether you’ve been ripping packs in the demo or you’re brand new to the desk, here’s a sneak peek at what’s waiting for you in the full game.1,431 Cards You Haven’t Seen YetThe demo was just the warm-up. The full game brings 1,431 brand-new cards to hunt down, taking the total collection to 1,809 cards across 209 unique Critkin. That’s a lot of binder pages to fill, and a lot of god-tier pulls to cele","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029619","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:35:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5088440-1846651706691094","game_id":"steam-5088440","kind":"announcement","title":"Rip It! Card Collector is in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Attention, Recruit! Steam Next Fest has begun and so many amazing demos are competing for your attention. Obviously, Team Ballistic entered the arena as well!The bosses at Team Ballistic HQ are extremely pleased to share that Rip It! Card Collector is among the featured demos. Isn't this just the perfect opportunity to get new recruits like you acquainted with our operation ahead of launch on October 30th?No more excuses: Rip It! and let us know how you like it!Checking out Steam Next Fest? Look","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:30:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5088440-1846018067943929","game_id":"steam-5088440","kind":"announcement","title":"The Rip It! Card Collector Demo is Available Now!","summary":"Attention, Recruit!The Rip It! Card Collector demo is now available to play ahead of the Steam Next Fest. This gives you the unique chance to already tear open packs, discover ultra-rare cards, and start filling your binder. Here is what you can do in the demo:Open card packs of various typesSort your new cards into your binderSell duplicates for extra moneyLevel up and unlock upgradesUse the Rip Rig to open multiple packsPlay at your own pace with relaxing, incremental progressionShake the pigg","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943929","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5088440-1844751498224737","game_id":"steam-5088440","kind":"announcement","title":"Get your own card in Rip It! Card Collector","summary":"As a new recruit to Team Ballistic, you need to collect all CritKin cards, which depict animals/creatures mixed with elements: There are 🔥fire cats🐱, 🌿nature cyclopes👁️, 🪐cosmic dogs🐶,... But what Critkin would you like to collect? How to participate in this community competitionDraw your own card.Join our official Discord.UPDATED: Post your drawing in the card-art-competition channel by October 12, 2026. The deadline has been extended by 1 week! What you can winThe best drawings will be selecte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T14:26:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224737","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5088440-1844751498221366","game_id":"steam-5088440","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Rip It! Card Collector – Collect 1809 cards to complete your binder","summary":"Welcome, Recruit! We’re excited to be revealing Rip It! Card Collector, our new game about finding, collecting, and sorting 1,809 trading cards into a binder! Your job is to not only purchase and rip packs on the hunt for rare Critkin pulls, but also to upgrade your arsenal of gadgets that help you complete your card collection more efficiently. New recruit orientation starts now. Watch the trailer below for a quick briefing on what is expecting you! Rip It! Card Collector will feature: 1,809 ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:42:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/stea